{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkwLS1CZWZvcmUvS3VkcmF0JTIwJTI4MTk4MSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Kudrat","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/er41MfrANQR7bVvDXLoQH0sY3dT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jGjNcpjP1x03gjHGmixQS0hWlTC.jpg","description":"The setting is in scenic Simla, summer capital of the British Raj in the 1970's. Chandramukhi from Bombay is on holiday with her parents and so is Naresh, a US educated medical professional with his parents. Chandramukhi and Naresh show interest in each other, encouraged by their parents. Choudhary Janak Singh, an important and wealthy man lives with his lawyer daughter Karuna in a lovely colonial period mansion. Their house-guest Mohan, a lawyer from Chandigarh is a protege of Janak Singh. Karuna and Mohan develop a romantic interest. The story of Paro and Madho, who lived in pre-independence India comes to affect the present.\n\nReleased 3 Apr 1981 · India · Language: Hindi · 164 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"1981","genres":["Romance","Drama","Mystery","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"164 min","cast":["Rajesh Khanna","Raaj Kumar","Hema Malini","Priya Rajvansh","Vinod Khanna","Aruna Irani","Deven Verma","Om Shivpuri"],"director":["Chetan Anand"],"released":"1981-04-03T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Chetan Anand","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r2RSj6l0bKQTN0FsNqPQ1Ym2swH.jpg"},{"name":"Rajesh Khanna","character":"Mohan Kapoor / Madho","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e32HlV5NRNKeEh654OKgMQJfU2r.jpg"},{"name":"Raaj Kumar","character":"Choudhury Janak Singh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tnc3pjbXOm518nxplB6CsThVUR6.jpg"},{"name":"Hema Malini","character":"Chandramukhi / Paro","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dfNRjtvbxisRSBDhCoUMuEFyY3V.jpg"},{"name":"Priya Rajvansh","character":"Karuna Singh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/egATXy6Z